1
00:00:28,414 --> 00:00:30,625
Previously on Dating Alys Perez.

2
00:00:30,791 --> 00:00:32,492
Don't worry, okay?

3
00:00:33,753 --> 00:00:35,335
After this,

4
00:00:36,756 --> 00:00:38,031
I'll be gone, too.

5
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:44,680
Zy, please.

6
00:00:44,680 --> 00:00:45,890
You're going over
the speed limit, Zy.

7
00:00:46,057 --> 00:00:47,308
- Please!
- I don't care!

8
00:00:47,642 --> 00:00:49,185
Please, listen to me!

9
00:00:49,185 --> 00:00:51,270
If you have a problem,
we can talk about it, please!

10
00:00:51,270 --> 00:00:52,730
Just stop the car, Zy, please!

11
00:00:53,898 --> 00:00:54,607
Please, Zy!

12
00:01:11,415 --> 00:01:13,334
Help!

13
00:01:14,502 --> 00:01:16,712
Help!

14
00:02:19,942 --> 00:02:21,360
Tripp!

15
00:02:52,224 --> 00:02:53,497
Alys?

16
00:04:57,433 --> 00:04:58,517
Andy...

17
00:04:58,851 --> 00:05:00,811
Alys is too vulnerable.

18
00:05:01,097 --> 00:05:03,689
She has been through a lot lately.

19
00:05:04,190 --> 00:05:06,775
I don’t know if she can still endure this.

20
00:05:07,693 --> 00:05:10,070
I don’t want her to go spiral.

21
00:05:10,513 --> 00:05:12,348
Why is this happening to her?

22
00:05:13,199 --> 00:05:15,011
How are we going to tell her?

23
00:05:16,702 --> 00:05:17,417
Mom?

24
00:05:18,162 --> 00:05:18,871
Alys!

25
00:05:19,496 --> 00:05:20,873
Finally, you're awake!

26
00:05:21,415 --> 00:05:22,208
Are you okay?

27
00:05:22,208 --> 00:05:23,667
I mean, do you feel hurt?

28
00:05:23,667 --> 00:05:25,002
Is there any pain?

29
00:05:25,002 --> 00:05:25,836
Tell me!

30
00:05:25,836 --> 00:05:27,379
Mommy's going to take care of you.

31
00:05:28,047 --> 00:05:29,590
Mom, I can't move.

32
00:05:29,590 --> 00:05:30,549
It hurts.

33
00:05:32,760 --> 00:05:34,303
Don't move just yet, okay?

34
00:05:34,987 --> 00:05:36,597
Baby, you're injured.

35
00:05:37,514 --> 00:05:39,183
Focus on getting well.

36
00:05:39,683 --> 00:05:42,770
Then we will tell you everything
when you get better.

37
00:05:43,187 --> 00:05:44,042
Okay?

38
00:05:47,650 --> 00:05:48,839
Zy!

39
00:05:49,735 --> 00:05:50,792
Help!

40
00:05:52,870 --> 00:05:54,031
Mom, where's Tripp?

41
00:05:54,448 --> 00:05:55,532
Mom, where's Tripp?

42
00:05:55,866 --> 00:05:56,884
Where's Tripp?

43
00:05:56,909 --> 00:05:58,035
Is he okay?!

44
00:05:58,035 --> 00:05:58,702
- Tell me.
- Alys...

45
00:05:58,702 --> 00:06:00,204
- Mom, Mom.
- Not right now...

46
00:06:00,204 --> 00:06:01,080
Not right now, dear.

47
00:06:01,080 --> 00:06:02,456
I need to know!

48
00:06:02,456 --> 00:06:03,707
No, no, no...

49
00:06:04,083 --> 00:06:06,085
- Mommy, where's Tripp?
- Focus on getting better, okay?

50
00:06:06,085 --> 00:06:07,378
Listen to us.

51
00:06:07,378 --> 00:06:08,587
- Okay?
- No!

52
00:06:08,587 --> 00:06:10,506
No! No, Mommy.

53
00:06:10,506 --> 00:06:11,882
Please tell me where Tripp is.

54
00:06:11,882 --> 00:06:13,759
- That's all I need to know.
- Alys...

55
00:06:13,759 --> 00:06:16,387
I just wanna know if he's okay.
I just want to see him.

56
00:06:16,387 --> 00:06:19,390
Just for a bit, Mommy.
I promise I won't cry anymore.

57
00:06:19,807 --> 00:06:21,141
Please, Mommy.

58
00:06:21,141 --> 00:06:23,978
Please, Mommy.
I just wanna see Tripp.

59
00:06:24,645 --> 00:06:27,231
Doc, is it possible to calm her down?

60
00:06:27,231 --> 00:06:29,650
What happened to him?
Why aren't you answering me?

61
00:06:29,650 --> 00:06:30,693
No.

62
00:06:30,693 --> 00:06:31,735
She's hurting.

63
00:06:31,735 --> 00:06:34,029
Why aren't you answering?

64
00:06:34,405 --> 00:06:36,031
Where is he?

65
00:06:36,031 --> 00:06:37,283
- Sweetie...
- Tell me, Mommy.

66
00:06:37,283 --> 00:06:39,618
- Shhh...
- Mommy, no!

67
00:06:39,618 --> 00:06:41,328
No, Mommy!
Tell me what happened!

68
00:06:41,328 --> 00:06:43,706
Please, Please!
No, please!

69
00:06:44,248 --> 00:06:47,084
Mommy!

70
00:07:08,063 --> 00:07:09,481
Where is Alys Perez?
What room is she in?

71
00:07:09,481 --> 00:07:10,566
Calm down, Sir.

72
00:07:10,566 --> 00:07:11,692
I need to see my wife!

73
00:07:11,692 --> 00:07:14,653
I'll need an ID so we can verify
and give you a visitor's pass.

74
00:07:14,653 --> 00:07:15,571
Sir!

75
00:07:15,571 --> 00:07:16,530
Sir!

76
00:07:16,530 --> 00:07:17,448
Sir!

77
00:07:17,448 --> 00:07:18,782
Sir!

78
00:07:18,807 --> 00:07:19,600
Sir!

79
00:07:49,480 --> 00:07:50,689
Uncle!

80
00:07:52,399 --> 00:07:53,609
Drake.

81
00:07:55,819 --> 00:07:58,113
Where is Alys?
I want to see her, please.

82
00:08:04,995 --> 00:08:06,205
She's inside.

83
00:08:07,039 --> 00:08:07,909
Go ahead.

84
00:08:29,436 --> 00:08:30,896
- Auntie.
- Drake.

85
00:08:33,686 --> 00:08:35,234
She's stable now.

86
00:08:36,276 --> 00:08:40,447
We even asked the doctor
earlier to sedate her.

87
00:08:41,824 --> 00:08:45,119
Because she was so restless
earlier when she woke up.

88
00:08:48,539 --> 00:08:50,791
She'll be fine.
She's in good hands here, Drake.

89
00:08:50,791 --> 00:08:51,834
Alys...

90
00:08:55,546 --> 00:08:58,424
I think you have to check on Tripp,
see how he's doing.

91
00:08:59,341 --> 00:09:00,311
Tripp?

92
00:09:01,760 --> 00:09:04,021
Alys was with Tripp when it happened.

93
00:09:05,222 --> 00:09:07,433
Alys was driving his car.

94
00:09:08,267 --> 00:09:11,678
And I was told that they
came from Cristine's house.

95
00:09:31,165 --> 00:09:32,295
How are you?

96
00:09:38,755 --> 00:09:40,716
Are you blaming yourself?

97
00:09:42,301 --> 00:09:43,092
Don't.

98
00:09:45,137 --> 00:09:47,264
No one wanted this to happen.

99
00:09:47,264 --> 00:09:48,474
It’s nobody's fault.

100
00:09:49,349 --> 00:09:50,767
Things happen.

101
00:09:53,854 --> 00:09:55,147
But why Alys?

102
00:09:56,648 --> 00:09:57,941
Why Tripp?

103
00:10:01,987 --> 00:10:03,989
That’s what we don’t know.

104
00:10:05,699 --> 00:10:07,701
All we can do now

105
00:10:08,160 --> 00:10:09,203
is pray.

106
00:10:09,953 --> 00:10:12,122
And wait until they get better.

107
00:10:16,919 --> 00:10:18,212
Don't worry.

108
00:10:19,213 --> 00:10:20,839
They’ll be well taken care of here.

109
00:10:52,996 --> 00:10:55,082
Thank goodness Bestie
wasn’t seriously hurt, right?

110
00:10:55,832 --> 00:10:56,833
Seriously?

111
00:10:57,125 --> 00:10:59,002
That's a tactless thing to say, you know.

112
00:10:59,593 --> 00:11:00,761
What should I say instead?

113
00:11:01,255 --> 00:11:01,880
I’m sorry.

114
00:11:01,880 --> 00:11:04,216
You know I have no finesse
when it comes to talking.

115
00:11:05,300 --> 00:11:06,260
All I’m saying is,

116
00:11:06,510 --> 00:11:08,428
I'm so happy Alys is alive.

117
00:11:08,428 --> 00:11:10,347
She’s okay, even if—

118
00:11:14,351 --> 00:11:15,437
Bestie?

119
00:11:19,022 --> 00:11:20,078
Hey, Bestie!

120
00:11:21,400 --> 00:11:22,484
It's Aya!

121
00:11:22,776 --> 00:11:24,444
I'm here with Sheen.

122
00:11:27,081 --> 00:11:28,332
Can you see us, Bestie?

123
00:11:28,615 --> 00:11:30,701
- Of course she can see us!
- Ouch!

124
00:11:31,243 --> 00:11:32,578
She isn't blind, you know.

125
00:11:33,036 --> 00:11:34,204
Come on, Aya.

126
00:11:34,830 --> 00:11:35,414
No!

127
00:11:35,414 --> 00:11:39,084
I meant if she can see us
clearly or even recognize us.

128
00:11:39,334 --> 00:11:40,294
Come on.

129
00:11:40,294 --> 00:11:42,004
You didn’t have to hit me that hard.

130
00:11:43,422 --> 00:11:45,132
Aya. Sheen.

131
00:11:48,735 --> 00:11:49,653
Bestie!

132
00:11:49,678 --> 00:11:50,422
Ouch!

133
00:11:50,762 --> 00:11:52,389
Good grief, Aya!

134
00:11:52,639 --> 00:11:54,224
Just don't touch her, please.

135
00:11:55,017 --> 00:11:57,144
- I’m sorry, Bestie.
- Are you okay?

136
00:11:57,144 --> 00:11:58,729
Don't touch her.

137
00:11:58,729 --> 00:12:00,105
You okay?

138
00:12:00,105 --> 00:12:00,814
Promise?

139
00:12:05,235 --> 00:12:07,946
Sorry for taking so long to visit, Bestie.

140
00:12:08,155 --> 00:12:12,200
Your mom wouldn't let us
see you until you got better.

141
00:12:13,619 --> 00:12:15,287
How are you?

142
00:12:17,122 --> 00:12:19,166
You know, Bestie?
I'm glad.

143
00:12:19,166 --> 00:12:20,751
I'm glad to see you doing better.

144
00:12:21,710 --> 00:12:23,670
Have you been able to eat again?

145
00:12:23,962 --> 00:12:26,548
Also Bestie, we got you some fruits,

146
00:12:26,923 --> 00:12:28,592
cupcakes,

147
00:12:29,593 --> 00:12:31,011
donuts,

148
00:12:31,011 --> 00:12:33,639
and other tasty food.

149
00:12:36,475 --> 00:12:38,518
If there’s anything else you’re craving,

150
00:12:39,728 --> 00:12:40,771
just let me know.

151
00:12:43,273 --> 00:12:45,859
Aya's overdoing it as always.

152
00:12:45,859 --> 00:12:48,636
It’s as if there's a feeding
program in the hospital.

153
00:12:49,112 --> 00:12:50,614
What's your problem?
This is a good thing.

154
00:12:50,614 --> 00:12:54,910
Even the nurses and staff
taking care of her get to eat, too.

155
00:12:55,297 --> 00:12:56,924
The food is for everybody.

156
00:12:57,287 --> 00:13:00,207
You've always been
such a buzzkill, CB.

157
00:13:00,207 --> 00:13:01,083
Hey!

158
00:13:01,333 --> 00:13:02,542
Would you stop calling me that?

159
00:13:02,542 --> 00:13:03,794
I'm not a crybaby anymore.

160
00:13:03,794 --> 00:13:05,170
- Really?
- Life has made me stronger.

161
00:13:05,170 --> 00:13:05,837
Are you sure?

162
00:13:05,837 --> 00:13:06,380
Yes.

163
00:13:06,380 --> 00:13:07,047
Whatever you say.

164
00:13:07,047 --> 00:13:08,090
Why? You’ve never cried before?

165
00:13:08,256 --> 00:13:09,591
In my mind,

166
00:13:09,925 --> 00:13:11,259
- you'll always be a crybaby.
- No!

167
00:13:11,259 --> 00:13:11,885
You've never cried then?

168
00:13:11,885 --> 00:13:13,095
- Whatever!
- I didn’t cry!

169
00:13:13,095 --> 00:13:13,828
Need I remind you of
our high school days?

170
00:13:13,853 --> 00:13:14,613
Have you never been
heartbroken before?

171
00:13:14,638 --> 00:13:15,472
Don't remind me of highschool.

172
00:13:15,472 --> 00:13:16,390
- We don't have to go that far back.
- Such a crybaby!

173
00:13:16,390 --> 00:13:17,391
I'm no crybaby.

174
00:13:17,391 --> 00:13:18,433
- I’m not a crybaby!
- Aya!

175
00:13:18,433 --> 00:13:19,017
Bestie?

176
00:13:20,310 --> 00:13:21,228
Bestie?

177
00:13:21,228 --> 00:13:22,104
Do you need anything?

178
00:13:23,522 --> 00:13:24,481
How's Tripp?

179
00:13:25,607 --> 00:13:26,166
Oh!

180
00:13:26,191 --> 00:13:27,442
Uhh...

181
00:13:29,403 --> 00:13:31,738
He's doing fine, Bestie.

182
00:13:31,947 --> 00:13:34,116
He's recovering, just like you.

183
00:13:35,367 --> 00:13:37,828
He's well taken care of.

184
00:13:43,500 --> 00:13:44,876
Bestie,

185
00:13:47,796 --> 00:13:49,798
there's no need to worry about Tripp.

186
00:13:50,320 --> 00:13:52,155
What matters is that

187
00:13:52,551 --> 00:13:54,052
you're both doing well,

188
00:13:54,261 --> 00:13:56,263
and recovering.

189
00:13:56,763 --> 00:13:58,223
You need to get stronger.

190
00:13:58,640 --> 00:14:00,767
Focus on yourself, okay?

191
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:02,602
Knowing how much

192
00:14:02,602 --> 00:14:04,104
you worry about others

193
00:14:04,104 --> 00:14:05,731
and take care of the people you love.

194
00:14:08,650 --> 00:14:11,027
You’ll be able to do all that
once you’re better.

195
00:14:11,770 --> 00:14:13,272
Get better.

196
00:14:26,793 --> 00:14:29,254
And with that...

197
00:14:31,148 --> 00:14:33,233
Sheen and I have to go.

198
00:14:33,258 --> 00:14:34,259
- Right?
- What?

199
00:14:35,051 --> 00:14:36,136
Oh yeah.

200
00:14:40,307 --> 00:14:42,017
Just focus on getting better.

201
00:14:42,267 --> 00:14:43,032
Okay?

202
00:14:43,132 --> 00:14:46,386
Aya and I just came by to
see how you were doing.

203
00:14:47,355 --> 00:14:49,691
To check up on Tripp too, right?

204
00:14:50,859 --> 00:14:52,235
Don't strain yourself, Alys.

205
00:14:52,861 --> 00:14:53,653
Promise?

206
00:14:54,571 --> 00:14:56,573
Regain your strength and recover.

207
00:14:57,407 --> 00:14:58,700
We’re here for you.

208
00:15:03,246 --> 00:15:05,582
Alright, Bestie.
You need to rest.

209
00:15:05,999 --> 00:15:08,335
Get better and stronger.

210
00:15:08,710 --> 00:15:11,588
If you want anything to eat,
let your mom know.

211
00:15:13,063 --> 00:15:15,235
And I'll bring it to you when I come back.

212
00:15:16,635 --> 00:15:17,803
Bestie,

213
00:15:17,803 --> 00:15:19,513
Get well.
We're right here, okay?

214
00:15:27,979 --> 00:15:29,134
Let’s go.

215
00:15:35,487 --> 00:15:36,279
Come on.

216
00:15:37,572 --> 00:15:38,782
Bye, Alys.

217
00:15:40,742 --> 00:15:41,952
Where’s Tripp?

218
00:15:43,578 --> 00:15:44,788
Where’s Tripp?

219
00:15:45,747 --> 00:15:47,874
I know they’re lying about Tripp.

220
00:15:49,626 --> 00:15:50,669
Where’s Tripp?

221
00:16:14,776 --> 00:16:15,735
Drake.

222
00:16:15,735 --> 00:16:17,072
How's my wife?

223
00:16:17,779 --> 00:16:18,488
Drake.

224
00:16:18,488 --> 00:16:19,656
It's fine. I'm here.

225
00:16:19,656 --> 00:16:20,323
I'm not leaving you.

226
00:16:20,323 --> 00:16:22,075
Drake, where is Tripp?

227
00:16:23,660 --> 00:16:24,953
Drake, where is Tripp?

228
00:16:25,328 --> 00:16:26,538
Are you hungry?

229
00:16:26,538 --> 00:16:27,914
Do you need anything?

230
00:16:28,748 --> 00:16:30,417
Drake, where is Tripp?

231
00:16:31,080 --> 00:16:33,795
Your mom brought
Arroz Caldo earlier.

232
00:16:34,045 --> 00:16:36,047
She asked me to feed
you when you wake up.

233
00:16:36,047 --> 00:16:37,049
You want some?

234
00:16:38,425 --> 00:16:39,362
Drake.

235
00:16:40,385 --> 00:16:42,929
Please tell me. Where is Tripp?

236
00:16:45,056 --> 00:16:46,391
Oh, a sponge bath.

237
00:16:46,391 --> 00:16:48,476
Wait, I'll call the nurse.

238
00:16:48,935 --> 00:16:50,338
Drake!

239
00:16:58,408 --> 00:16:59,518
Auntie.

240
00:17:01,673 --> 00:17:03,666
We'll handle this.

241
00:17:03,825 --> 00:17:05,243
Go home and rest, okay?

242
00:17:05,827 --> 00:17:07,537
But what about Alys?

243
00:17:07,537 --> 00:17:09,998
Drake, I insist.

244
00:17:10,123 --> 00:17:12,208
You’ll end up getting sick
if you keep this up.

245
00:17:12,208 --> 00:17:13,960
You'll wind up in a hospital bed too.

246
00:17:14,878 --> 00:17:15,770
Okay.

247
00:17:15,795 --> 00:17:16,504
Okay?

248
00:17:16,504 --> 00:17:18,131
I'll come back tomorrow, Auntie.

249
00:17:18,298 --> 00:17:19,846
Alright, get some sleep.

250
00:17:24,179 --> 00:17:26,222
I'll be back tomorrow, okay, Alys?

251
00:17:28,183 --> 00:17:29,392
Alys.

252
00:17:38,610 --> 00:17:40,362
- Baby?
- Mom?

253
00:17:41,529 --> 00:17:43,281
Mom, where is Tripp?

254
00:17:45,022 --> 00:17:47,399
Why aren't you answering me?

255
00:17:49,454 --> 00:17:51,498
Why won't you answer me?

256
00:17:51,498 --> 00:17:53,124
I'm just asking a question.

257
00:17:53,124 --> 00:17:55,710
Where is he?
Is he dead? Is he alive?

258
00:17:55,710 --> 00:17:57,420
I don't know anything!

259
00:17:58,588 --> 00:18:00,548
Mommy!

260
00:18:00,548 --> 00:18:05,011
Where is Tripp, please?
Let me know, Mom!

261
00:18:50,348 --> 00:18:51,558
Excuse me, Sir.

262
00:18:51,558 --> 00:18:52,350
Thank you.

263
00:19:13,714 --> 00:19:14,886
Eat, Alys.

264
00:19:15,498 --> 00:19:17,208
If you keep this up, you’re going
to lose those adorable cheeks.

265
00:19:17,208 --> 00:19:19,210
That’s one of the things I fell for.

266
00:19:20,670 --> 00:19:21,487
Here.

267
00:19:23,048 --> 00:19:24,841
How's Tripp?

268
00:19:29,512 --> 00:19:30,831
Eat up, Alys.

269
00:19:32,474 --> 00:19:33,940
Even just one bite.

270
00:19:34,225 --> 00:19:37,062
When you're strong enough,
I'll take you to Tripp myself.

271
00:19:43,380 --> 00:19:44,354
Come on.

272
00:20:53,680 --> 00:20:55,056
Is she better now?

273
00:20:56,516 --> 00:20:57,433
Getting better.

274
00:20:58,476 --> 00:20:59,469
Recovering.

275
00:21:00,436 --> 00:21:01,729
I'm sorry, Cous.

276
00:21:03,064 --> 00:21:04,691
But you have to go through this.

277
00:21:05,733 --> 00:21:07,110
I know you're closer to Tripp.

278
00:21:07,569 --> 00:21:08,820
But I appreciate that.

279
00:21:09,737 --> 00:21:10,601
Come on.

280
00:21:11,781 --> 00:21:13,074
Tripp and I love you.

281
00:21:13,992 --> 00:21:15,451
We're here for you.

282
00:21:16,286 --> 00:21:17,022
How's Tripp?

283
00:21:17,871 --> 00:21:18,830
Any news?

284
00:21:19,455 --> 00:21:20,248
Well...

285
00:21:21,249 --> 00:21:22,083
Auntie came.

286
00:21:23,293 --> 00:21:24,586
She's not happy.

287
00:21:25,879 --> 00:21:26,629
She's blaming her—

288
00:21:26,629 --> 00:21:27,803
I'll try to talk to her.

289
00:21:32,635 --> 00:21:33,397
Tripp.

290
00:21:50,320 --> 00:21:51,487
Oh, baby Alys.

291
00:21:51,487 --> 00:21:53,698
You know what your dad did the other day?

292
00:21:53,784 --> 00:21:55,953
He tried to cook soup!

293
00:21:56,117 --> 00:21:57,785
It's so salty!

294
00:21:57,785 --> 00:21:59,579
But I still finished it.

295
00:21:59,579 --> 00:22:00,726
It wasn't salty.

296
00:22:01,372 --> 00:22:02,140
Huh?

297
00:22:02,165 --> 00:22:04,042
Don't try to defend it.

298
00:22:04,042 --> 00:22:05,418
It’s really salty.

299
00:22:05,418 --> 00:22:06,669
Anyways, do you know?

300
00:22:06,669 --> 00:22:09,172
Your aunts miss you so much.

301
00:22:09,172 --> 00:22:11,382
Then they asked me when you'll be home.

302
00:22:11,382 --> 00:22:12,759
I told them, very soon.

303
00:22:12,759 --> 00:22:14,636
Then there's Aya,

304
00:22:14,636 --> 00:22:16,554
she was a bit angry.

305
00:22:16,554 --> 00:22:18,348
She told me that when you go out,

306
00:22:18,348 --> 00:22:19,849
she'll be the first one
to take you to the spa

307
00:22:19,849 --> 00:22:21,809
because she said
your life is too stressful.

308
00:22:22,477 --> 00:22:25,688
Then, your nanny!
She's excited to see you.

309
00:22:25,688 --> 00:22:27,148
- When you get home—
- Auntie, Uncle!

310
00:22:27,856 --> 00:22:29,061
Oh, Drake!

311
00:22:29,484 --> 00:22:30,187
Hello.

312
00:22:30,777 --> 00:22:32,111
Where can I put this, Auntie?

313
00:22:32,239 --> 00:22:33,115
Oh, let me.

314
00:22:33,956 --> 00:22:36,709
Oh, were you able to sleep?

315
00:22:37,116 --> 00:22:37,999
Barely.

316
00:22:39,035 --> 00:22:40,912
It's obvious from your eyes.

317
00:22:40,912 --> 00:22:41,882
Have you eaten?

318
00:22:42,288 --> 00:22:44,916
Not yet, I was hoping Alys
and I would eat together.

319
00:22:45,041 --> 00:22:46,167
Oh, you know what?

320
00:22:46,459 --> 00:22:47,627
The flowers can wait.

321
00:22:48,127 --> 00:22:49,796
Uh, we'll leave you with Baby Alys.

322
00:22:49,796 --> 00:22:50,755
Baby Alys!

323
00:22:51,339 --> 00:22:52,840
Daddy and I have to go outside.

324
00:22:52,840 --> 00:22:53,841
We'll be back.

325
00:22:54,259 --> 00:22:54,717
Okay.

326
00:22:54,842 --> 00:22:55,741
- Thank you.
- Bye.

327
00:22:56,177 --> 00:22:56,874
Uncle.

328
00:22:59,055 --> 00:22:59,722
Alys.

329
00:22:59,722 --> 00:23:00,265
What?

330
00:23:01,182 --> 00:23:02,642
I brought you something.

331
00:23:03,977 --> 00:23:05,436
Do you remember this?

332
00:23:06,559 --> 00:23:10,646
This was the first food
we shared together at SCA.

333
00:23:13,069 --> 00:23:14,028
This is good.

334
00:23:30,920 --> 00:23:34,090
Eat up so you can get your
strength back and recover.

335
00:23:34,090 --> 00:23:36,224
Where's Tripp? Bring me to him.

336
00:23:38,344 --> 00:23:39,381
Come on, Alys.

337
00:23:40,972 --> 00:23:42,515
Take me to Tripp!

338
00:23:42,515 --> 00:23:43,975
Are you deaf or what?!

339
00:23:48,609 --> 00:23:50,652
I just want to see Tripp.

340
00:23:51,346 --> 00:23:53,765
I just want to make sure he's okay.

341
00:23:54,944 --> 00:23:56,112
Drake, please.

342
00:23:56,112 --> 00:23:57,613
Even for just 10 seconds.

343
00:23:57,613 --> 00:23:59,866
I just want to see Tripp.

344
00:24:00,533 --> 00:24:01,426
Drake!

345
00:24:01,451 --> 00:24:02,368
Alys...

346
00:24:07,498 --> 00:24:08,545
Even if I wanted to..

347
00:24:10,543 --> 00:24:11,669
What?

348
00:24:12,337 --> 00:24:14,130
You wish you can, but you can't?

349
00:24:15,631 --> 00:24:18,468
Just this once, Drake.

350
00:24:19,927 --> 00:24:22,180
Stand your ground for once!

351
00:24:24,015 --> 00:24:25,141
You're a fucking man!

352
00:24:25,141 --> 00:24:26,267
You're a grown man!

353
00:24:26,267 --> 00:24:27,490
Act like it!

354
00:24:27,977 --> 00:24:29,395
Go to fucking Fier!

355
00:24:31,189 --> 00:24:32,857
You got Fier pregnant, right?

356
00:24:33,608 --> 00:24:35,401
Take some goddamn responsibility.

357
00:24:36,819 --> 00:24:39,906
Did you know I tried so hard
to keep her from leaving?

358
00:24:41,032 --> 00:24:41,866
Hmm?

359
00:24:44,702 --> 00:24:45,536
So hard.

360
00:24:48,373 --> 00:24:49,256
Why?

361
00:24:49,874 --> 00:24:51,167
Why did I do it?

362
00:24:55,380 --> 00:24:57,965
Because I knew it was hard on you!

363
00:25:01,135 --> 00:25:03,012
You're so stupid, Alys.

364
00:25:05,807 --> 00:25:07,683
You're so stupid, Alys.

365
00:25:08,726 --> 00:25:10,812
You're so goddamn stupid, Alys.

366
00:25:15,358 --> 00:25:18,528
Do you know how much
I changed for you?

367
00:25:18,528 --> 00:25:21,781
Because I loved you so much, Drake?

368
00:25:25,034 --> 00:25:26,411
Go ahead, Alys.

369
00:25:27,245 --> 00:25:28,287
Go ahead!

370
00:25:28,913 --> 00:25:29,956
You can do it.

371
00:25:34,752 --> 00:25:37,588
You'll just have to swallow
your pride for Drake.

372
00:25:42,635 --> 00:25:43,136
Fuck.

373
00:25:46,931 --> 00:25:48,683
I was so pathetic, wasn't I?

374
00:25:49,976 --> 00:25:51,214
But that's okay.

375
00:25:51,561 --> 00:25:53,354
I'm not blaming you for that.

376
00:25:56,566 --> 00:25:57,733
It was my choice.

377
00:26:02,029 --> 00:26:03,656
I chose to be stupid.

378
00:26:05,575 --> 00:26:08,578
I'm just letting it all out now.

379
00:26:09,287 --> 00:26:11,372
Because it hurts so much

380
00:26:11,372 --> 00:26:13,624
and I'm so tired of you, Drake.

381
00:26:17,462 --> 00:26:18,921
After everything I've done for you,

382
00:26:18,921 --> 00:26:20,715
this is the least you can do for me.

383
00:26:20,715 --> 00:26:22,925
And you can’t even grant
me this one request?!

384
00:26:36,543 --> 00:26:38,253
Take me to Tripp.

385
00:26:41,611 --> 00:26:43,404
If you have some pity for me, please.

386
00:26:45,573 --> 00:26:47,533
Do you really want me to go crazy?

387
00:26:49,510 --> 00:26:50,928
Bring me to Tripp

388
00:26:50,953 --> 00:26:52,830
if you don't want me to go crazy, Drake.

389
00:27:20,691 --> 00:27:21,626
Alys.

390
00:27:21,651 --> 00:27:22,573
Please, Drake.

391
00:27:24,070 --> 00:27:25,530
I need to see Tripp.

392
00:27:27,698 --> 00:27:29,700
Alys, you can’t see Tripp.

393
00:27:29,700 --> 00:27:30,417
Why?

394
00:27:32,870 --> 00:27:33,784
Alys.

395
00:27:34,997 --> 00:27:36,123
Alys!

396
00:27:47,543 --> 00:27:48,378
Let's go.

397
00:27:50,346 --> 00:27:51,264
Alys, let's go.

398
00:27:54,642 --> 00:27:55,560
Tripp!

399
00:27:56,060 --> 00:27:58,563
What is that woman doing here?

400
00:27:58,771 --> 00:28:00,147
You have some nerve!

401
00:28:00,856 --> 00:28:04,110
Get her away from me before
I start making a scene.

402
00:28:04,527 --> 00:28:05,464
Okay, Auntie.

403
00:28:06,571 --> 00:28:07,409
Let's go.

404
00:28:07,738 --> 00:28:08,948
Drake, no!

405
00:28:08,948 --> 00:28:09,824
No, please!

406
00:28:09,824 --> 00:28:12,159
I want to see Tripp even for a moment.

407
00:28:12,159 --> 00:28:13,035
Please, Drake.

408
00:28:13,035 --> 00:28:14,245
Drake, please.

409
00:28:14,245 --> 00:28:15,788
I'm begging you.

410
00:28:15,788 --> 00:28:16,789
Please.

411
00:28:17,623 --> 00:28:18,402
Please.

412
00:28:19,175 --> 00:28:19,987
Please.

413
00:28:20,876 --> 00:28:22,336
That's all I want.

414
00:28:22,336 --> 00:28:23,045
Please.

415
00:28:23,838 --> 00:28:24,964
Alys, listen to me.

416
00:28:25,923 --> 00:28:26,465
Please.

417
00:28:26,591 --> 00:28:27,883
That's Tripp's mom.

418
00:28:28,884 --> 00:28:30,177
Don't visit him anymore.

419
00:28:30,177 --> 00:28:31,870
Auntie is really mad at you.

420
00:28:32,489 --> 00:28:36,076
But I didn’t want that to happen, Drake.

421
00:28:37,393 --> 00:28:38,102
I know.

422
00:28:39,186 --> 00:28:40,479
We know that.

423
00:28:42,857 --> 00:28:44,859
Tell her I'm very sorry.

424
00:28:45,151 --> 00:28:46,027
Please tell her.

425
00:28:46,152 --> 00:28:47,862
Please tell her I didn't mean
for any of this to happen.

426
00:28:47,862 --> 00:28:48,821
Please tell her.

427
00:28:48,821 --> 00:28:50,406
How dare you!

428
00:28:53,659 --> 00:28:56,245
I left with my son healthy.

429
00:28:56,245 --> 00:28:57,455
And now I returned.

430
00:28:57,455 --> 00:29:01,042
And now he's in a coma
with multiple internal injuries?

431
00:29:01,959 --> 00:29:03,502
How dare you!

432
00:29:04,253 --> 00:29:05,963
I'm very sorry.

433
00:29:05,963 --> 00:29:08,132
I really didn't mean
for anything to happen.

434
00:29:08,299 --> 00:29:09,133
I'm very sorry.

435
00:29:09,133 --> 00:29:11,802
You do not deserve to see my son!

436
00:29:13,721 --> 00:29:15,306
I know.

437
00:29:15,306 --> 00:29:19,560
But just give me a
moment with him, please!

438
00:29:19,560 --> 00:29:23,814
Even just for a moment,
I just want to see Tripp.

439
00:29:24,398 --> 00:29:25,214
Please.

440
00:29:26,317 --> 00:29:28,277
You almost killed him.

441
00:29:29,195 --> 00:29:31,614
You almost killed my son!

442
00:29:31,781 --> 00:29:33,532
And you killed your own baby?

443
00:29:34,075 --> 00:29:35,675
What kind of mother are you?!

444
00:29:38,245 --> 00:29:40,164
What do you mean?

445
00:29:42,416 --> 00:29:43,918
My own baby?

446
00:29:45,336 --> 00:29:46,796
What do you mean?

447
00:29:48,923 --> 00:29:49,667
Uh...

448
00:30:05,398 --> 00:30:06,982
Is it true, Drake?

449
00:30:09,777 --> 00:30:11,237
Is it true?!

450
00:30:12,255 --> 00:30:12,964
Drake...

451
00:30:14,573 --> 00:30:16,534
Drake, I'm so sorry.

452
00:30:16,534 --> 00:30:18,077
I didn't know that she didn't know.

453
00:30:19,245 --> 00:30:21,747
I didn't mean it to come from me.

454
00:30:25,584 --> 00:30:27,628
You two need to talk, okay?

455
00:30:31,716 --> 00:30:32,495
Drake.

456
00:30:36,971 --> 00:30:37,972
Alys.

457
00:30:40,203 --> 00:30:42,163
you were a few weeks pregnant.

458
00:30:43,800 --> 00:30:46,386
The accident led to a miscarriage.

459
00:31:13,382 --> 00:31:15,384
I hate you!

460
00:31:16,225 --> 00:31:18,227
I hate you!

461
00:31:19,722 --> 00:31:23,100
I hate you!

462
00:31:58,266 --> 00:31:59,350
Alys, I'm sorry.

463
00:32:00,429 --> 00:32:01,514
Leave me alone.

464
00:32:04,159 --> 00:32:06,180
I don't want to see you, Drake.

465
00:32:09,021 --> 00:32:10,883
Alys, I'm hurting too.

466
00:32:13,192 --> 00:32:14,693
Let me grieve with you.

467
00:32:16,237 --> 00:32:17,112
Grieve with me?

468
00:32:18,948 --> 00:32:20,199
Bullshit.

469
00:32:23,118 --> 00:32:25,788
Do you know what's the root of all this?

470
00:32:26,872 --> 00:32:30,709
My fucking love for you, Drake.

471
00:32:32,044 --> 00:32:37,049
And I always lose something
whenever I choose you.

472
00:32:39,760 --> 00:32:43,305
I don't want you in my life anymore.

473
00:32:44,014 --> 00:32:45,933
So please...

474
00:32:48,853 --> 00:32:50,271
please just go.

475
00:32:50,271 --> 00:32:51,258
Just...

476
00:32:51,981 --> 00:32:53,190
leave.

477
00:32:53,941 --> 00:32:54,483
Alys, please.

478
00:32:54,483 --> 00:32:56,485
You've hurt me so much, Drake.

479
00:32:56,944 --> 00:32:58,696
I've had enough of this.

480
00:33:01,115 --> 00:33:02,449
Alys, please.

481
00:33:03,659 --> 00:33:06,537
I'm so tired, Drake.

482
00:33:06,537 --> 00:33:09,498
I'm so tired of you.

483
00:33:10,124 --> 00:33:12,042
I'm giving up on you.

484
00:33:14,044 --> 00:33:15,963
I'm giving up on you.

485
00:33:22,595 --> 00:33:23,762
Let's end this.

486
00:34:07,348 --> 00:34:08,933
Okay, the bills are paid.

487
00:34:08,933 --> 00:34:10,476
Are we forgetting anything?

488
00:34:12,144 --> 00:34:14,021
Ma'am, here's the copy of receipt.

489
00:34:14,355 --> 00:34:15,731
Oh, thank you.

490
00:34:15,731 --> 00:34:16,649
Are we ready to go?

491
00:34:16,899 --> 00:34:18,901
Yeah, just give us five more minutes.

492
00:34:18,901 --> 00:34:19,485
Okay, sure ma'am.

493
00:34:19,485 --> 00:34:20,819
Okay, thank you.

494
00:34:24,281 --> 00:34:25,532
Ready to go home, dear?

495
00:34:29,745 --> 00:34:32,623
I'm so excited you're
coming home with us today.

496
00:34:32,790 --> 00:34:34,375
Dane is waiting for you.

497
00:34:34,583 --> 00:34:36,251
I already cleaned your room.

498
00:34:36,710 --> 00:34:37,795
Your sheets are fresh.

499
00:34:37,795 --> 00:34:40,560
Of course, I want you
to feel rested at home.

500
00:34:40,673 --> 00:34:41,841
Aren't you excited?

501
00:34:43,092 --> 00:34:43,759
Sorry, Mom.

502
00:34:43,759 --> 00:34:45,594
But I'll stay at the condo for now.

503
00:34:45,886 --> 00:34:46,912
Huh?

504
00:34:46,964 --> 00:34:47,882
But why?

505
00:34:49,556 --> 00:34:51,517
I just want to process things first.

506
00:34:51,517 --> 00:34:53,227
A lot has happened.

507
00:34:54,937 --> 00:34:57,398
I know, but don't you think we'll be

508
00:34:57,398 --> 00:34:59,233
able to take care of you better at home?

509
00:34:59,441 --> 00:35:00,693
Come on, Dad.

510
00:35:00,943 --> 00:35:02,945
I'm not a kid anymore.

511
00:35:03,237 --> 00:35:04,947
I can handle myself.

512
00:35:04,947 --> 00:35:06,532
I almost became a mother.

513
00:35:07,324 --> 00:35:09,076
Even if I found out from
someone else.

514
00:35:17,115 --> 00:35:18,825
Look, Mom, Dad.

515
00:35:19,670 --> 00:35:20,879
I understand the concern.

516
00:35:20,879 --> 00:35:22,006
I truly do.

517
00:35:22,464 --> 00:35:24,717
I get why you withheld so many truths

518
00:35:24,717 --> 00:35:28,470
within a span of weeks, but

519
00:35:29,847 --> 00:35:33,267
that doesn't mean I can't get hurt, right?

520
00:35:35,519 --> 00:35:36,562
We understand.

521
00:35:37,021 --> 00:35:39,481
But are you sure you can manage?

522
00:35:40,149 --> 00:35:40,858
Yes, Mom.

523
00:35:40,941 --> 00:35:41,734
I can manage.

524
00:35:42,026 --> 00:35:44,570
And plus, the hospital
is closer to my condo.

525
00:35:44,570 --> 00:35:46,572
So, I can visit Tripp easily.

526
00:35:46,822 --> 00:35:48,699
Can I please send the nanny with you?

527
00:35:48,991 --> 00:35:51,160
So you'll have someone
to clean and cook for you.

528
00:35:51,994 --> 00:35:53,078
No need, Mom.

529
00:37:53,365 --> 00:37:54,936
- Perez!
- Bestie!

530
00:37:55,576 --> 00:37:56,869
Hey.

531
00:38:00,164 --> 00:38:01,456
What happened?

532
00:38:03,250 --> 00:38:06,044
I killed my baby.

533
00:38:12,122 --> 00:38:13,913
Hey, this is my favorite.

534
00:38:14,219 --> 00:38:15,345
Look at this.

535
00:38:15,837 --> 00:38:17,755
You didn't even use a serving spoon.

536
00:38:18,765 --> 00:38:19,725
Eat all of that.

537
00:38:19,725 --> 00:38:20,413
Eat!

538
00:38:21,268 --> 00:38:24,479
Didn't know you were this sensitive.

539
00:38:25,022 --> 00:38:25,928
Huh?

540
00:38:25,981 --> 00:38:27,749
Isn't that basic knowledge?

541
00:38:27,774 --> 00:38:29,902
It'll go bad faster
without a serving spoon.

542
00:38:30,360 --> 00:38:31,612
It won't go bad.

543
00:38:32,080 --> 00:38:33,748
We'll finish this tonight!

544
00:38:34,823 --> 00:38:36,450
It's not even enough
for us three, right Alys?

545
00:38:39,244 --> 00:38:41,496
Can ice cream really help with sadness?

546
00:38:43,198 --> 00:38:43,824
Why?

547
00:38:43,849 --> 00:38:44,809
Are you sad?

548
00:38:46,877 --> 00:38:47,794
A little.

549
00:38:48,003 --> 00:38:49,755
But I'm not as sad as Alys.

550
00:38:50,088 --> 00:38:51,882
So, Kent and you had a fight, right?

551
00:38:53,300 --> 00:38:55,552
Hmm... you're a little gossip, aren't you?

552
00:38:56,053 --> 00:38:57,346
How did you know?

553
00:38:58,166 --> 00:38:59,293
And what's it to you?

554
00:39:01,042 --> 00:39:03,295
You're more invested in
my love life than I am.

555
00:39:04,540 --> 00:39:08,002
I heard that you don't have a girlfriend.

556
00:39:08,273 --> 00:39:11,818
Why don't you find someone so
you don't meddle with any of ours?

557
00:39:14,696 --> 00:39:15,572
So, Bestie?

558
00:39:16,323 --> 00:39:18,033
Do you want to do anything tonight?

559
00:39:18,951 --> 00:39:19,826
Movie marathon?

560
00:39:21,370 --> 00:39:22,579
Board games?

561
00:39:23,121 --> 00:39:24,039
Sound trip?

562
00:39:25,749 --> 00:39:26,764
Karaoke?

563
00:39:28,672 --> 00:39:30,215
I know you'll love this.

564
00:39:30,240 --> 00:39:30,949
Let's grab a drink!

565
00:39:31,137 --> 00:39:32,030
Oh god.

566
00:39:32,339 --> 00:39:33,465
Can we not go drinking?

567
00:39:33,924 --> 00:39:35,342
She's recovering.

568
00:39:36,093 --> 00:39:37,459
Something might happen to her again.

569
00:39:38,011 --> 00:39:39,147
Oh, right.

570
00:39:39,801 --> 00:39:41,344
Sorry, not today.

571
00:39:42,849 --> 00:39:46,812
Whatever it is, Alys, we got you.

572
00:39:47,176 --> 00:39:48,511
Of course!

573
00:39:50,023 --> 00:39:51,358
Over.

574
00:39:51,608 --> 00:39:52,484
Thank you.

575
00:40:16,301 --> 00:40:17,386
So unfair.

576
00:40:19,565 --> 00:40:21,400
You're still handsome as ever.

577
00:40:23,223 --> 00:40:24,933
You promised me, right?

578
00:40:25,559 --> 00:40:28,478
You said we're soulmates.

579
00:40:28,812 --> 00:40:30,772
And soulmates don't leave each other.

580
00:40:31,898 --> 00:40:34,484
You said you'll help me with everything.

581
00:40:36,528 --> 00:40:38,238
Just this once, please, Tripp.

582
00:40:38,947 --> 00:40:40,561
Just help me with this.

583
00:40:42,034 --> 00:40:43,285
Keep fighting, okay?

584
00:40:44,286 --> 00:40:45,746
You can't die on me.

585
00:40:46,788 --> 00:40:47,681
You can't.

586
00:40:47,706 --> 00:40:48,707
I won't allow it.

587
00:40:48,707 --> 00:40:50,292
You can't leave me.

588
00:41:02,554 --> 00:41:04,181
Miss Alys, time's up.

589
00:41:04,181 --> 00:41:04,931
Let's go.

590
00:41:04,931 --> 00:41:05,842
Let's go please.

591
00:41:09,186 --> 00:41:10,479
I'll come back for you, okay?

592
00:41:21,698 --> 00:41:22,549
Okay.

593
00:41:22,574 --> 00:41:23,413
See you.

594
00:41:40,058 --> 00:41:43,395
Alys, I brought you some
flowers and some food.

595
00:41:43,804 --> 00:41:44,805
Let's eat.

596
00:41:56,900 --> 00:41:58,610
Drake, what else do I have to do

597
00:41:58,610 --> 00:42:00,153
to make you stop?

598
00:42:02,197 --> 00:42:04,241
We've been over for two months now.

599
00:42:05,742 --> 00:42:06,952
We broke up already.

600
00:42:06,952 --> 00:42:08,537
What else do you want?

601
00:42:09,079 --> 00:42:09,907
Alys.

602
00:42:11,373 --> 00:42:12,958
Here we go again.

603
00:42:15,252 --> 00:42:17,295
What else do you want?!

604
00:42:17,295 --> 00:42:19,840
Drake, why won't you let me go?!

605
00:42:22,092 --> 00:42:22,884
Let me go!

606
00:42:22,884 --> 00:42:23,657
Go away!

607
00:42:23,682 --> 00:42:24,845
Go away!

608
00:42:24,845 --> 00:42:25,679
- Alys...
- Leave!

609
00:42:25,679 --> 00:42:26,972
Don't fucking touch me!

610
00:42:27,514 --> 00:42:29,224
Don't touch me!

611
00:42:31,643 --> 00:42:32,540
Leave.

612
00:42:33,770 --> 00:42:35,230
I said leave!

613
00:42:39,416 --> 00:42:42,282
Stop waiting for someone who's
already waiting for someone else.

614
00:42:54,416 --> 00:42:56,293
Save yourself, Drake.

615
00:42:57,294 --> 00:42:58,003
That's enough.

616
00:42:59,087 --> 00:43:00,297
Have pity on yourself.

617
00:43:03,091 --> 00:43:03,884
That's enough.

618
00:43:16,605 --> 00:43:18,148
Let's end this.

619
00:44:02,984 --> 00:44:08,497
Not a single day has passed where I haven't
blamed myself for what happened.

620
00:44:15,622 --> 00:44:18,067
Please wake up, Tripp.

621
00:44:22,045 --> 00:44:25,966
There's so much I have
to make up to you.

622
00:44:32,681 --> 00:44:35,100
Tripp, please wake up.

623
00:44:37,936 --> 00:44:39,854
I'll make it up to you, I promise.

624
00:44:42,732 --> 00:44:45,235
You won't be sad ever again.

625
00:44:45,777 --> 00:44:48,154
You'll see, we'll just be happy.

626
00:45:07,173 --> 00:45:09,426
Why is all of this happening to me?

627
00:45:11,970 --> 00:45:14,055
To the people close to me.

628
00:45:16,433 --> 00:45:18,184
Am I cursed?

629
00:45:19,686 --> 00:45:24,691
Am I the worst person in the world
for fate to punish me like this?

630
00:45:45,902 --> 00:45:46,986
Drake.

631
00:45:49,674 --> 00:45:50,759
Fier.

632
00:45:51,926 --> 00:45:53,762
Thank God you called.

633
00:45:54,054 --> 00:45:54,967
Where are you?

634
00:45:55,722 --> 00:45:57,474
I heard about what happened.

635
00:45:58,350 --> 00:45:59,768
So I decided to call.

636
00:46:01,019 --> 00:46:02,270
Thank you.

637
00:46:04,648 --> 00:46:07,067
May I know where you are right now?

638
00:46:09,444 --> 00:46:11,237
For now, not yet.

639
00:46:13,114 --> 00:46:15,241
I'm not the one you
should be worried about.

640
00:46:19,028 --> 00:46:21,947
I just wanted to apologize for everything.

641
00:46:24,834 --> 00:46:27,253
I had to leave for my own sanity.

642
00:46:28,505 --> 00:46:32,550
Everything was getting too much and
everything was out of control.

643
00:46:33,593 --> 00:46:36,638
And I think everybody just
needs a little breathing.

644
00:46:38,556 --> 00:46:40,521
And I just needed to be alone.

645
00:46:43,311 --> 00:46:44,099
But...

646
00:46:45,397 --> 00:46:46,398
what about...

647
00:46:47,524 --> 00:46:48,608
what about...

648
00:46:48,608 --> 00:46:51,027
who will take care of the baby?

649
00:46:54,197 --> 00:46:55,323
I'll be fine.

650
00:46:55,990 --> 00:46:57,492
I'll focus on myself.

651
00:46:58,380 --> 00:46:59,756
And you should too.

652
00:47:02,421 --> 00:47:04,529
Fix your situation with Alys.

653
00:47:05,458 --> 00:47:07,168
I know that she's your real love.

654
00:47:08,211 --> 00:47:10,171
Despite giving us a shot,

655
00:47:11,107 --> 00:47:12,692
you didn't choose me.

656
00:47:14,342 --> 00:47:15,760
You didn't choose us.

657
00:47:17,678 --> 00:47:18,521
Fier.

658
00:47:19,144 --> 00:47:21,646
If you need anything,
just tell me, okay?

659
00:47:24,310 --> 00:47:25,478
At this moment?

660
00:47:27,647 --> 00:47:28,474
Nothing.

661
00:47:29,858 --> 00:47:31,151
Just let me be.

662
00:47:31,693 --> 00:47:34,112
Don't worry about me.

663
00:47:34,988 --> 00:47:35,864
About us.

664
00:47:37,037 --> 00:47:38,013
We're fine.

665
00:47:40,452 --> 00:47:42,662
Don't beat yourself up, Drake.

666
00:47:43,413 --> 00:47:45,582
I know how hard it is
for you right now.

667
00:47:45,957 --> 00:47:47,792
Especially with what happened to Alys.

668
00:47:49,878 --> 00:47:51,921
That's why I won't
add to your burden.

669
00:47:52,338 --> 00:47:54,048
For now, focus on her.

670
00:47:54,507 --> 00:47:55,759
She needs you more.

671
00:47:56,718 --> 00:47:57,260
But...

672
00:47:57,343 --> 00:47:58,803
Relax, Drake.

673
00:48:00,638 --> 00:48:02,891
I can think clearly if I'm
away from all this chaos.

674
00:48:04,975 --> 00:48:06,018
Who knows?

675
00:48:07,771 --> 00:48:08,980
Maybe one day,

676
00:48:08,980 --> 00:48:12,025
I'll let you know where we'll be.

677
00:48:13,234 --> 00:48:14,402
But for now,

678
00:48:15,519 --> 00:48:16,520
take care.

679
00:48:17,405 --> 00:48:19,574
I hope Alys will get better.

680
00:48:23,161 --> 00:48:24,329
Thank you, Fier.

681
00:48:25,580 --> 00:48:26,498
Thank you.

682
00:48:50,480 --> 00:48:51,731
I'm sorry.

683
00:48:54,150 --> 00:48:55,610
I'm sorry, Alys.

684
00:49:01,115 --> 00:49:03,576
I cooked all your favorite food.

685
00:49:03,576 --> 00:49:04,994
That's why you need to eat a lot.

686
00:49:04,994 --> 00:49:07,539
You don't know how
happy your mom was

687
00:49:07,539 --> 00:49:09,040
when she found out you'll drop by.

688
00:49:10,333 --> 00:49:13,419
Now I'm starting to believe
you are her favorite child.

689
00:49:17,173 --> 00:49:20,134
Mom, I'm going back to the shop.

690
00:49:20,561 --> 00:49:21,371
Huh?

691
00:49:21,970 --> 00:49:23,304
Are you sure you're okay?

692
00:49:23,638 --> 00:49:25,807
I mean, no one's rushing you.

693
00:49:26,015 --> 00:49:28,059
You can take all the time that you need.

694
00:49:29,352 --> 00:49:32,564
I just thought, it's better
if I do something than...

695
00:49:32,564 --> 00:49:33,356
You know what?

696
00:49:33,356 --> 00:49:34,858
Whatever you need, honey.

697
00:49:35,108 --> 00:49:36,276
Your Dad and I
will always be here.

698
00:49:36,276 --> 00:49:39,237
Alys, we will never get
tired of supporting you.

699
00:49:39,237 --> 00:49:40,238
Remember that.

700
00:49:40,864 --> 00:49:41,739
Thank you, Dad.

701
00:49:41,739 --> 00:49:42,532
Thank you, Mom.

702
00:49:42,532 --> 00:49:44,033
Okay, let's eat.

703
00:49:44,033 --> 00:49:44,993
Nanny?

704
00:49:45,326 --> 00:49:45,910
Yes, Ma'am?

705
00:49:45,910 --> 00:49:48,037
I put the dessert in the freezer.

706
00:49:48,204 --> 00:49:49,581
Don't forget, okay?

707
00:49:49,581 --> 00:49:50,707
It's frozen.

708
00:49:50,707 --> 00:49:51,249
Yes, Ma'am.

709
00:49:51,249 --> 00:49:52,083
Okay, thank you.

710
00:49:52,083 --> 00:49:53,293
I’ll check, thank you.

711
00:49:53,543 --> 00:49:54,544
You know what, honey?

712
00:49:54,544 --> 00:49:55,795
I'm so glad you're home.

713
00:49:57,672 --> 00:49:59,215
You sure you don't want
to come back here?

714
00:49:59,549 --> 00:50:01,199
I promise I won't fight you again.

715
00:50:03,511 --> 00:50:04,530
I'm okay.

716
00:50:04,555 --> 00:50:05,640
Don't worry.

717
00:50:06,139 --> 00:50:06,973
You sure?

718
00:50:08,600 --> 00:50:11,436
If Drake is bothering you,
just let me know.

719
00:50:21,988 --> 00:50:22,989
Oh, my god.

720
00:50:22,989 --> 00:50:23,823
What's wrong?

721
00:50:25,408 --> 00:50:27,452
Mom, Dad, I need to go.

722
00:50:28,328 --> 00:50:29,465
Where are you going?

723
00:50:30,246 --> 00:50:31,539
Tofer just texted me.

724
00:50:31,539 --> 00:50:32,707
I need to go to the hospital.

725
00:50:32,707 --> 00:50:33,833
It's pretty urgent.

726
00:50:34,709 --> 00:50:36,753
Can you please finish your food first?

727
00:50:40,965 --> 00:50:43,009
Eat some more.

728
00:51:02,737 --> 00:51:04,030
- Ma'am Kat.
- Yes?

729
00:51:04,030 --> 00:51:05,740
Where's the patient?

730
00:51:06,324 --> 00:51:07,909
Weren’t you informed?

731
00:51:08,117 --> 00:51:08,826
About what?

732
00:51:09,160 --> 00:51:10,286
Sir is gone.

733
00:51:13,831 --> 00:51:14,999
Sorry, Ma'am.

734
00:51:43,194 --> 00:51:43,736
Okay.

735
00:51:44,028 --> 00:51:44,821
See you.

736
00:51:55,832 --> 00:51:57,709
I'll see you tomorrow, my son.

737
00:51:58,707 --> 00:51:59,651
I gotta go.

738
00:52:22,734 --> 00:52:23,800
Hello, cousin.

739
00:52:26,828 --> 00:52:28,163
I'm here to wish you well.

740
00:52:30,950 --> 00:52:33,369
People have always
compared us to each other.

741
00:52:34,871 --> 00:52:36,414
They even pit us against
each other sometimes.

742
00:52:37,582 --> 00:52:39,834
But I never took it seriously.

743
00:52:41,839 --> 00:52:44,294
I don't know why we weren't close.

744
00:52:45,456 --> 00:52:47,499
We have a lot of similarities, Tripp.

745
00:52:49,208 --> 00:52:50,959
We can talk about a lot of things.

746
00:52:52,002 --> 00:52:53,462
We could have been friends.

747
00:52:56,759 --> 00:52:58,901
Tripp, you know a lot of people love you.

748
00:53:00,480 --> 00:53:02,356
Alys visits you every day.

749
00:53:02,356 --> 00:53:03,733
Secretly, without Auntie knowing.

750
00:53:07,904 --> 00:53:09,739
And I know that even
if she doesn't tell me,

751
00:53:09,739 --> 00:53:12,116
it hurts her to see you like this.

752
00:53:13,117 --> 00:53:16,120
So please, wake up.

753
00:53:22,627 --> 00:53:24,295
And by the way,

754
00:53:25,421 --> 00:53:27,090
Alys broke up with me.

755
00:53:30,051 --> 00:53:32,345
But I won't give up like before.

756
00:53:33,763 --> 00:53:34,931
I'll wait for her.

757
00:54:08,005 --> 00:54:10,216
What I'm asking from you is simple.

758
00:54:10,216 --> 00:54:12,260
Tell me where you took him!

759
00:54:22,645 --> 00:54:23,771
Okay, thank you.

760
00:54:24,188 --> 00:54:25,081
What Dane?

761
00:54:25,106 --> 00:54:26,268
Were you able to contact her?

762
00:54:26,399 --> 00:54:27,066
Not yet.

763
00:54:27,066 --> 00:54:28,025
Her phone is off.

764
00:54:29,318 --> 00:54:30,237
Alys.

765
00:54:31,362 --> 00:54:32,446
Come on, pick up.
